as reaching 5000 points for song play or reaching 3rd place in the season high score, you will receive a character profile icon as a reward.<br></li><li>Compete with players from all over the world and challenge the top 5 players with the points earned through rhythm game play for each song. Your score and name fuel the enthusiasm of players. Try again even if you are not in the Hall of Fame. The top 5 roster is reset every season.<br></li><li>Cleave notes flying in various directions, throw punches and dodge them by moving your body. Through play that moves the whole body</li></ul>",
